  "description": "WireMock-equivalent HTTP stub server for .NET, runnable as a project and consumable from any Aspire AppHost. Single assembly that bundles the in-process stub server (AddHttpEcho / MapHttpEcho), the AppHost integration (AddHttpEcho, WithStub, WithHttpEchoEnvironment), declarative validations (RequireJsonField, RequireJsonNumberRange, RequireHeader, RequireQuery), and a HttpStubBase class for code-based stubs.",
